@startuml
node "Customer device" { artifact "Browser / PWA" as PWA }
cloud "Internet / HTTPS" as NET
node "GitHub CI" { artifact "Quality gate" as CI; artifact "GHCR image : SHA" as REG }
node "Render production" { node "Web Docker service" as WEB { artifact "Next.js standalone" as NEXT } node "API Docker service" as API { artifact "NestJS + Prisma" as NEST } database "Managed PostgreSQL
private network + persistent disk" as DB }
node "Developer local" { artifact "Docker Compose web/api/db" as LOCAL; artifact ".env local" as ENV }
PWA --> WEB : HTTPS 443
WEB --> API : HTTPS 443 / API
API --> DB : PostgreSQL private connection
CI --> REG : push SHA (GITHUB_TOKEN)
REG --> WEB : deploy image
REG --> API : deploy image
API --> DB : migrate deploy
API --> API : /api/health + logs
ENV ..> LOCAL : local configuration
note bottom of CI
Boundaries: local / CI / production. Runtime secrets in platform secret store. DB has no public ingress.
end note
@enduml
